# The pinned inputs of scripts/guest/vulkan-ready.sh (AC-T7.4.1). Debian trixie's Mesa 25.0.7 Venus is the
# guest driver Shards tested against its virglrenderer 1.3.0 renderer on an NVIDIA RTX 5060 Ti and a Radeon
# 610M, each rendering on its host driver (Shards docs/design/architecture.md D201, crates/shards/tests/gpu.rs).
# The image is named by its index digest, and apt reads one snapshot.debian.org instant, so each package
# version below is fixed there; apt refuses a version the snapshot lacks rather than taking another.
IMAGE=debian@sha256:a72b4433de1cf7d6bae0c4cee74d0547f58601a643b3375f070c51600d63b6b2
SNAPSHOT=20261110T000000Z
PACKAGES="gcc=4:14.2.0-1 libc6-dev=2.41-12+deb13u4 libvulkan-dev=1.4.309.0-1 libvulkan1=1.4.309.0-1 mesa-vulkan-drivers=25.0.7-2+deb13u1"
